        "research_rationale": "Identity and text: read in full in the registered text of 8 FR 16957 (issue of 1943-12-21, PDF page 3; the held file is the reading-order rebuild of the official scan's OCR, EO_9405.recheck.txt, grade original_representation_unverified, acceptable_as_original true, not an authenticated transcription). The order is headed 'Amending Subdivision IX of Schedule A of the Civil Service Rules', signed December 17, 1943, and amends paragraph 9 of Subdivision IX (Department of Agriculture) to read: Farm Credit Administration positions in the Federal Intermediate Credit Banks, the Production Credit Corporations, the Federal Land Banks, the Banks for Cooperatives and joint-officer positions. Inventory: the amending sentence and paragraph 9. End: EO 9830, Part III, \"The following Executive orders are hereby revoked:\" lists \"No. 9405 of December 17, 1943.\" (held ACT record, official Federal Register text, 12 FR 1259). EO 9830's restated Schedule A re-lists the same Farm Credit Administration banks' positions as an independent entry.\nMember checks: {\"earlier_end_check\":\"No own-terms end. Chain empty. EO 9653 (1945-11-01) amends Subdivision IX paragraphs 4 and 26 (headings read; the earlier independent review also records 27 and 28), not paragraph 9; no other held order numbered 9406-9829 amends paragraph 9 (normalised search for 'Subdivision IX of Schedule A'). The earlier independent AI review of the EO 9830 list (research/excavator/rastell-2026-10-20/r9830/review/REVIEW.jsonl) reached the same finding. Search coverage: the later-events catalogue (OFR disposition notes from 1937) and the held order texts; Public Land Orders and Civil Service Commission notices printed in issues without an executive order are not searched.\",\"independent_command_check\":\"The Schedule A restatement in EO 9830 is a separate command that re-lists the positions; it is not a continuation of EO 9405.\",\"savings_check\":\"See savings reason.\",\"scope_check\":\"Both clauses fall under the revocation of the whole order by number and date; no partial revocation is indicated.\"}",
